oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031392_381033337811787_5701494533830343396_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HKWlyhA4SE4Q7kNvwFyomZz&_nc_oc=AdrrOm7PfHs_s358Juoih5SaSfF4lDbEwDIMRB9QB7qr05a4OHncfzyJJ8-vzqpDVhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBXvqpWqDxl34Zx_SKfX1Awk6W4hZKYABn4mkksrOG9pg&oe=6A4A630B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "24.png", "id": "479792944623870", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031358_479792947957203_7701327199303146140_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hc7u6cCSC8EQ7kNvwEeUBwg&_nc_oc=Ador3fEQ5vVNoopCANyxzkbyEUmWi4E1VEuhAyl8vpOQMuM33AWMcWjgLrxXnsPW3cU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAScoZvRY6KhRp6AznhbmkVi7TYpW6JuuhH07xoMaEpqw&oe=6A4A6CAC"}, "display_name": "Gracia", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Gracia is a platform that redefines virtual reality, offering free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual.\n\nKey features:\n\n- Unmatched Photorealism: Gracia\u2019s advanced rendering technology blurs the line between virtual and reality and creates a feeling as if you are inside high-resolution photograph. \n- 6DOF Volumetric Scenes: Move and interact within our scenes with complete freedom as if you were really there.\n- Extremely High Fidelity: Up to 550 fps at native resolution.\n- Ever Expanding Store of Scenes: Regular updates keep the content fresh and exciting.", "short_description": "Gracia is a world's first platform with free-viewpoint ultra-photorealistic VR experiences. It's not just about seeing; it's about stepping inside a photo with freedom to walk around, where every detail is so vivid, you'll forget it's virtual."}]}, "developer_name": "Gracia", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://graciavr.notion.site/Privacy-P